---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import ProcessSteps from '../components/ProcessSteps.astro';
import Engage from '../components/Engage.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base title="Process" description="How a RailsShark project runs, from a free discovery call to a written architecture plan, short build cycles, launch and support.">
  <PageHead
    title="How we work"
    lede="Every project follows the same route. It keeps surprises early, when they are cheap, and gives you working software to judge at every step."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ProcessSteps />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="engage-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section__head">
        <h2 id="engage-title">Ways to work with us</h2>
        <p>Pick the shape that fits the work. You can change it later; plenty of projects become dedicated teams.</p>
      </div>
      <Engage />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="wrap faq">
      <h2 id="faq-title">Questions we hear first</h2>
      <div>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you work with clients outside Pakistan?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Most of our work is remote, with clients and teams in other countries. We agree working hours and a communication rhythm at the start of each project.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Who owns the code?</summary>
          <p>You do. Source code, designs and documentation are yours, and live in your repositories and accounts from day one.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can you take over a project someone else started?</summary>
          <p>Yes. We start with a short review of the codebase and infrastructure, tell you plainly what we found, and then propose how to continue.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do you price work?</summary>
          <p>It depends on scope and the way we work together. After the discovery call you get a written plan with an estimate you can compare and approve.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Will you sign an NDA?</summary>
          <p>Yes, before you share anything confidential.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>

<style>
  .faq {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    gap: var(--s7);
  }

  .faq h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
  }

  details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  details:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: var(--s4) 2rem var(--s4) 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    list-style: none;
    position: relative;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  summary::after {
    content: '+';
    position: absolute;
    right: 0.25rem;
    top: 50%;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    font-size: 1.4em;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: rotate 0.2s var(--ease);
  }

  details[open] summary::after {
    rotate: 45deg;
  }

  details p {
    padding-bottom: var(--s5);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .faq {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--s5);
    }
  }
</style>
